# A complete polynomial certificate on [1/2,1] x [13,14]
The projection is onto -i(s-1): -Im(Q(s)conj(s-1)). Every coefficient below is
part of an EXACT identity for the rounded Q. The analytic source error is proved
separately; table positivity does not equate Q with normalized zeta H.
SOURCE SCRIPTS / NOT_ELABORATED / NOT_KERNEL_AUDITED.
-/
